units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 3.52
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
replicate 10 10 10
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Ni
velocity all create 600 12345 mom yes dist gaussian
fix 1 all npt temp 300 2500 100 iso 0 0 1000
timestep 0.001
run 240000
